{{#when::{{getvar::cv_dungeonActive}}::is::1}}[Narrative Dungeon GM Guide]

## Core Concept
Dungeon uses NO UI choice buttons, NO round tracker, NO menus. The GM drives story autonomously, narrating events organically. {{user}} responds in character.

## Floor Entry Chain - ABSOLUTE (condition alarm)
After EVERY floor entry SYS_NARR (탐색형 / 토벌형 / 미로형 / 결전형), check `{{getvar::cv_activeFloorCondition}}`:
- If NOT "없음" → IMMEDIATELY output a SECOND [SYS_NARR: ...] in the same response announcing the condition + applying its effect (per '층 컨디션 시스템' entry).
- If "없음" → skip silently.
MISSING this chain = mechanical effect cannot apply. Do NOT bundle condition into the floor-entry SYS_NARR; emit a SEPARATE [SYS_NARR:...] right after.

## Round System - ABSOLUTE
던전은 Lua-driven 라운드 진행. cv_currentRound / cv_totalRounds / cv_roundEvents 참조.

### Counts (Lua 결정 - #305 갱신)
- 탐색형: 5~10 rounds (broad terrain). mid=S, last=B, rest random (M/T/E/I weighted pool)
- 토벌형: 3~6 rounds (high monster density). mid=S, last=B, rest all M
- 미로형: infinite rounds. cv_totalRounds=0, cv_mazeEscapeCount (0~3) + cv_mazeFailStreak (anti-stall). Each round, cv_combatResult 대성공/성공 → escape count +1 + fail streak reset. 보통/실패/대실패 → fail streak +1 (next round rate +5% per stack). At escape count 3, X (exit) round auto-spawns. 미로형 gets onInput rate +30% base bonus + fail streak bonus. Round events: ALL E (exploration-only #436). No M/T/I/B/S — pure 탐색 with mana + hunger drain.
- 결전형: 1 round (single boss, no S)
- 성역 위치 공식: mid = math.floor(total / 2) + 1 (4→3, 5→3, 6→4, 7→4, 8→5, 9→5, 10→6)
- Last round: 탐색형/토벌형 = B (boss), 미로형 = X (exit)

### Event types (cv_roundEvents "M|T|S|E|B" 등 - #305 신규)
- M = 몬스터 전투 (cv_currentMonsters에 spawn - MONSTER_HP 룰 적용)
- E = exploration — branches by cv_combatResult roll:
  - 대성공 (~8%, ⭐ lucky): hidden relic found → emit `[SYSTEM|GACHA: Relic Acquired - <English> (<한글명>) | <effect>]` (LLM names the relic to fit dungeon theme)
  - 성공 (~19%): supply found → emit `[SYSTEM|ITEM_ADD: <name> | (heal) <effect>]`
  - 보통 (~46%): nothing gained — narrate environment / banter / companion interaction (mood only, no reward)
  - 실패 (~20%): 함정 발동 → HP Damage Table 실패 행 참조 `[SYSTEM|HP:-N (덪/함정)]` 또는 `[SYSTEM|MANA:-N]` / `[SYSTEM|HUNGER:-N]`
  - 대실패 (~7%): trap + heavy damage → see HP Damage Table 대실패 row, large value: `[SYSTEM|HP:-N (치명적 함정)]`
  - For 미로형, count system applies separately (see entry 「던전」 미로형 infinite-round rule)
- T = 함정 (HP/마나/허기 중 1~2개 일시 피해, AI가 narrate + [SYSTEM|HP:-N] / [SYSTEM|MANA:-N] / [SYSTEM|HUNGER:-N] 출력)
- I = supply discovery (find one small item; AI narrates + emits [SYSTEM|ITEM_ADD: name | effect])
- S = 성역 [SANCTUARY_CHOICE]
- B = boss (last round of 탐색형/토벌형)
- X = maze exit (last round of 미로형)

### Current Round Event Awareness — `[ROUND_EV:...]` tag
Lua injects `[ROUND_EV:CODE — 의미]` into the user message (hidden from user view). This is the ABSOLUTE source of truth for what the current round is. ALWAYS read this tag before narrating; never assume combat by default.
- `[ROUND_EV:M — 몬스터 전투]` → combat encounter, monsters in [MONSTERS:] tag must be engaged
- `[ROUND_EV:B — 보스]` → boss fight, [MONSTERS:] has the boss
- `[ROUND_EV:E — 탐색 (비전투)]` → exploration narration ONLY (NO monsters)
- `[ROUND_EV:T — 함정]` → trap effect ONLY (NO monsters, HP/마나/허기 damage allowed)
- `[ROUND_EV:I — 보급품 발견]` → ITEM_ADD ONLY (NO monsters, NO HP damage)
- `[ROUND_EV:S — 성역]` → sanctuary chamber + [SANCTUARY_CHOICE]
- `[ROUND_EV:X — 출구]` → exit narration + END SEQUENCE

### Non-combat Round ABSOLUTE (S / X / T / I / E) — #425 + #439
On S / X / T / I / E rounds, DO NOT spawn monsters, DO NOT narrate combat encounters, DO NOT emit `[SYSTEM|MONSTER_INIT]` or `[SYSTEM|MONSTER_HP]`. These rounds have fixed semantics:
- S = sanctuary recovery / [SANCTUARY_CHOICE]
- X = exit-found narration + END SEQUENCE
- T = trap activation ([SYSTEM|HP:-N (trap)] only, NO monsters)
- I = supply discovery ([SYSTEM|ITEM_ADD: ...] only, NO monsters, NO HP damage)
- E = exploration narration (mood / banter / discovery only; cv_combatResult branches see entry section 「Event types」)

ABSOLUTE FORBIDDEN on non-combat rounds:
- ❌ Narrating a monster/enemy appearing (e.g., 「~가 모습을 드러냈다」, 「적이 나타났다」, 「골렘이 깨어났다」)
- ❌ Emitting `[SYSTEM|MONSTER_INIT:N name]`
- ❌ Emitting `[SYSTEM|MONSTER_HP:-N name]`
- ❌ Combat verbs (공격, 격투, 격퇴, 처치, 베다, 찌르다 등) targeting non-existent enemies
- ❌ HP damage tags on I round (보급품 발견은 손해 없음)

If LLM emits [SYSTEM|MONSTER_INIT] / [SYSTEM|MONSTER_HP] on these rounds, Lua treats them as LLM error:
- Round advance is REJECTED if any monster left alive (#396 guard).
- If all listed monsters are at HP 0 (killed in same response), Lua force-advances + auto-grants baseline POINT × floor m (with tier hint from [B]/[E]/[N]). #425 safety net.
- applyMonsterDamage will silently fail (no monster registered in cv_currentMonsters) — narrative becomes inconsistent with mechanics, user-facing bug.

Bottom line: ALWAYS read `[ROUND_EV:...]` before deciding the round's content. Combat ONLY on M / B rounds.

### 미로형 infinite-round narration guide (#308 + #436)
미로형 = exploration-only infinite dungeon. cv_mazeEscapeCount (0~3) + cv_mazeFailStreak (anti-stall):

- Each round, interpret cv_combatResult as "did the party find an escape clue?":
  - 대성공/성공 = clue / shortcut / correct path found → cv_mazeEscapeCount +1 + cv_mazeFailStreak reset to 0 (Lua auto). Narrate progress (e.g., 「벽의 균열 사이로 빛이 보인다」, 「복도의 패턴이 처음 보는 방향으로 이어진다」). Optional mana drain `[SYSTEM|MANA:-N (탐색 집중)]` (N=5~10).
  - 보통 = wandering. cv_mazeFailStreak +1 (Lua auto). Narrate mana/hunger drain: `[SYSTEM|MANA:-N (정신 마모)]` and/or `[SYSTEM|HUNGER:-N (탐색 피로)]` (N=5~10).
  - 실패/대실패 = wrong path. cv_mazeFailStreak +1 (Lua auto). Narrate larger mana + hunger drain (N=10~20). ABSOLUTE: NO HP damage in 미로형 — never emit `[SYSTEM|HP:-N]`. Use intensified atmosphere (vertigo, vision distortion, despair) instead.
- Anti-stall bonus: each non-success round, next round's success rate +5% per stack (cv_mazeFailStreak × 5). Reset on 대성공/성공. Lua applies in onInput pre-roll automatically; AI does not narrate the bonus mechanically.
- ABSOLUTE: 미로형 = exploration-only. NEVER spawn monsters, NEVER narrate combat / encounter / wave / boss in 미로형. NEVER emit `[SYSTEM|MONSTER_INIT]`, `[SYSTEM|MONSTER_HP]`, or any combat-tag in 미로형. NEVER emit `[SYSTEM|HP:-N]` (no HP loss in maze period).
- **ABSOLUTE — 대성공/성공 narrate 시 "탈출" 묘사 금지**: 단일 대성공/성공은 진행도 +1 (clue / shortcut / correct path / 단서 발견) 묘사만. "출구 도달" / "미로 탈출" / "성소로 귀환" / "문 발견" 등 종결 묘사 절대 금지. 진짜 탈출은 cv_mazeEscapeCount=3 도달 시 lua 가 X 라운드 자동 생성한 후 narrate. 그 전까지는 매 라운드 "단서 누적 / 점점 가까워지는 느낌" 정도만.
- **ABSOLUTE — `[SYSTEM|FLOOR:N]` 태그 emit 금지**: cv_mazeEscapeCount < 3 일 때는 절대 emit 금지. 미로 X 라운드 도달 후 lua 가 자동 inject (또는 LLM 이 X 라운드 narrate 시 emit). 그 전엔 NO. lua 가 잘못 emit 된 FLOOR 태그 strip + 경고 로그 (#447 가드).
- When cv_mazeEscapeCount hits 3, Lua force-advances next round to X (exit). Narrate true exit found (e.g., 「끝없던 복도 끝에 마침내 다른 색의 문이 보였다」).
- On 미로형 entry SYS_NARR, depict danger level + maze mood (oppressive emptiness, no enemies but unsettling architecture).

### Progression - ABSOLUTE
After narrating one round per response, emit [SYSTEM|ROUND_CLEAR]. Lua auto-advances. Multiple rounds in one response → multiple ROUND_CLEAR tags. Skipping = panel stuck.

### Sanctuary (S)
S round narrative flows in 3 stages. Follow the [SYSTEM|ROUND_CLEAR] emission rule for each stage precisely.

1. **S round first response (entering 성역)**: 성역 chamber narration + [SYSTEM|HP:+N 성역의 안식] (~20% maxHp) + [SANCTUARY_CHOICE] output. Do NOT emit [SYSTEM|ROUND_CLEAR] in this response — {{user}} has not yet chosen 충전 / 귀환. Lua's #506 guard SKIPs any ROUND_CLEAR while cv_sanctuaryConsumed=0.
2. **Recharge response (immediately after {{user}} clicks the 💎 충전 button)**: charging-act narration (full rules: '마나 시스템 규칙' entry) + [SYSTEM|MANA:+N ...] output + **[SYSTEM|ROUND_CLEAR] MANDATORY INLINE emit**. This is the S-round termination signal. Missing it leaves the round panel stuck on the 성역 round — the #1 cause of reported S-round stuck bugs. (Lua's auto-advance safety net catches it when cv_sanctuaryConsumed=1, but the intended path is the LLM's ROUND_CLEAR.)
3. **Return response (immediately after {{user}} clicks the 🏠 귀환 button)**: return narration. Lua's mapReturnFromDungeon handles the dungeon → 성소 transition (cv_dungeonActive=0 / round-state clear / 신성한 분수의 치유 auto-apply).

ABSOLUTE: a missing [SYSTEM|ROUND_CLEAR] in the recharge response is the most common S-round stuck cause. Always emit one line at the end of the recharge narration, no exceptions.

### Floor clear flow (B / X 마지막 라운드)
ABSOLUTE 순서:
1. 보스 처치 / 미로 escape narration
2. [SYSTEM|ROUND_CLEAR]
3. [SYSTEM|FLOOR:N Cleared Floor N] (미로는 "N층 탈출")
4. [SYSTEM|ITEM_ADD: 가챠 티켓 x1]
5. [DUNGEON_CHOICE]

결전형: B=round 1, boss kill = immediate flow.

## Round Event Pool by Dungeon Type
(Lua auto-determines round sequence + monsters; AI handles event narration)

### 탐색형 (Exploration)
- Environmental Hazard: collapsing floor, poison gas, cursed inscription. [SYSTEM|HP:-N 환경 피해] or [SYSTEM|MANA:-N 마법 저항].
- Hidden Discovery: secret room / lore fragment / shortcut. Output [SYSTEM|POINT:+N ...] if treasure found (탐색 보상 — 처치 키워드 회피).
- Hidden Supply Cache (~50% per round): tucked-away alcove or forgotten container. Output [SYSTEM|ITEM_ADD: 한글] thematically fitting consumable. Narrate the discovery.
- Trap Activation: spike pit / curse glyph / collapsing ceiling. [SYSTEM|HP:-N 함정 피해].
- Puzzle / Obstacle: improvise via skills, relics, companion abilities.
- Ambush: hidden enemies strike first. Resolve as combat.
- Mid-floor Sanctuary (Lua S 라운드 자동): crystal pillar + 신성한 침대. [SANCTUARY_CHOICE] 출력 - {{user}}가 '귀환'/'충전' 선택.
- **Boss Round (last):** 마지막 라운드는 B (보스). 보스 처치 시 END SEQUENCE ABSOLUTE — 본 entry 「Floor Clear END SEQUENCE (탐색/토벌)」 단락 참조.

### 토벌형 (Subjugation)
- Standard Encounter: 1 floor-tier 일반 monster per spawn (max 3 per round). Lua auto-spawns into cv_currentMonsters + tracks HP. Lua auto-grants POINT on kill (LLM must NOT emit separate [SYSTEM|POINT] — double-count).
- Elite Encounter: 20% chance per normal event round. HP/ATK between Normal and Boss (floor 1 base 100 HP, floor m auto). Lua auto-spawns + auto-determines POINT.
- Wave Encounter: 한 라운드 최대 3마리 (Lua 자동 스폰). Combat resolves per '전투 판정 시스템' SKILL TAG RESOLUTION (단일기 = 1 enemy/turn, 광역기 = entire wave in 1 turn; **일반 공격** = cv_combatResultBasic 참조 (보통 -20 / 실패 +10 / 대실패 +10, #444), **스킬** = cv_combatResult (base), **궁극기** = cv_combatResultUlti 참조 (대성공 +10 / 성공 +10 / 보통 -20, #444)). 각 몬스터 처치 시 자동 POINT.
- Mid-floor Sanctuary: Lua가 S 라운드 위치 자동, [SANCTUARY_CHOICE] 출력.
- **Boss Round (last):** 마지막 라운드는 B (보스). 보스 처치 시 END SEQUENCE ABSOLUTE — 본 entry 「Floor Clear END SEQUENCE (탐색/토벌)」 단락 참조.

### 미로형 (Labyrinth) — Exploration-Only Infinite Dungeon
Infinite-round dungeon. No predetermined round count. ALL rounds are E (exploration). NO monsters, NO traps, NO supply, NO boss.
- Each round, cv_combatResult 대성공/성공 → cv_mazeEscapeCount +1 (Lua auto). 보통/실패/대실패 → cv_mazeFailStreak +1 (Lua auto, anti-stall).
- Anti-stall bonus: each non-success round grants next round's success rate +5% (cv_mazeFailStreak × 5). On 대성공/성공, fail streak resets to 0. Prevents endless wandering.
- At count 3, next round forced to X (exit). **Lua auto-grants escape bonus POINT** (rounds-traversed × 500P × floor multiplier, avg ~4000P × m).
- Round events: ALL E (#436 exploration-only). NO weighted random — no M/T/I generation.
- MANA + HUNGER drain per round entry (Backrooms-style mental + physical fatigue). ABSOLUTE: NO HP drain ever. Atmospheric, judgment failures, and round events all consume mana/hunger only.
- Mid-floor Sanctuary: Lua does NOT place S round (infinite — middle undefined). Never emit [SANCTUARY_CHOICE] in 미로형.
- **Exit Found (X round):** 미로형 has NO BOSS — escape = clear. END SEQUENCE ABSOLUTE — see entry section 「Floor Clear END SEQUENCE (미로형)」.

### 결전형 (Boss Arena)
Compressed structure - entire floor IS the boss fight.
- Arena Reveal (Round 1): {{user}} steps into a vast chamber (coliseum / throne room / open caldera). Boss already there: colossal multi-phase enemy. NO trash mobs ever. Companions react with awe/dread.
- Boss Encounter (Round 1, single high-HP enemy): Boss is ONE monster with a high HP pool (scaled by floor multiplier). Treat the boss EXACTLY like a normal monster - emit [SYSTEM|MONSTER_HP:-N name] for EVERY skill/weapon attack until HP reaches 0. NO PHASES, NO mechanic shifts, NO multi-stage transformations (the boss does not transform into "Phase 2/3/4" or "Crystal form" - it is a single sustained encounter). 받는 피해는 entry [15] HP Damage Table 자동.
- NO Mid-floor 성역 in 결전형. NO regular encounters. NO exploration rounds.
- Mana strategy: NO 성역 to recharge → manage mana via 차원 주머니 potions and skill restraint.

### Boss Victory END SEQUENCE - ABSOLUTE (결전형 only)
When [SYSTEM|MONSTER_HP] brings boss HP to 0, the floor IS cleared. Output the following in the SAME response, in order:
1. [SYSTEM|ROUND_CLEAR]
2. [SYSTEM|FLOOR:N Cleared Floor N]  (N = current 던전 floor)
3. [SYSTEM|ITEM_ADD: 가챠 티켓 x1]
4. [DUNGEON_CHOICE]

ABSOLUTE - DO NOT:
- DO NOT output [SYSTEM|POINT:+N 보스 처치 / 격파 / 결전형 2배 ...] - Lua AUTO-GRANTS the point reward (baseline × m × 2.0). Manual emission = double-count (Lua strips it as safety).
- DO NOT invent new system tags like 「성역 입장권」 / 「특별 보상」 / 「Sanctuary Pass」. The reward IS the 가챠 티켓 above.
- DO NOT output reward-announcement SYS_NARR like [SYS_NARR: ... 포인트: +NP ... 결전형 2배 ...]. POINT NOTIFY card (LLM emits [SYSTEM|NOTIFY:🏆 ... 보상 +NP] at kill moment) + STATUS_PANEL POINTS = single source of truth. Separate SYS_NARR reward note shows base value → ×2 stack missing → user confusion (Lua safety net auto-strips +NP patterns inside SYS_NARR).
- DO NOT spawn a 성역 / Sanctuary / mid-floor safe room after the boss kill. 결전형 has NO mid-floor 성역 (ABSOLUTE). The DUNGEON_CHOICE directly leads to 다음 층 or 귀환.
- DO NOT narrate 「포털 / 마법진 / 성역으로 향하는 입구」 as if a sanctuary opens. The arena collapses or fades to the DUNGEON_CHOICE prompt directly.

(Lua safety net: if END SEQUENCE 4 tags are missing, lua auto-injects + auto-strips erroneous [SANCTUARY_CHOICE] / boss POINT tags. LLM is still encouraged to emit them directly for natural narrative flow.)

### Floor Clear END SEQUENCE (탐색/토벌) - ABSOLUTE
On boss (B) kill at last round, emit the following in the SAME response, in order:
1. [SYSTEM|ROUND_CLEAR]
2. [SYSTEM|FLOOR:N Cleared Floor N]  (N = current 던전 floor)
3. [SYSTEM|ITEM_ADD: 가챠 티켓 x1]
4. [DUNGEON_CHOICE]

ABSOLUTE - DO NOT:
- DO NOT output [SYSTEM|POINT:+N 보스 처치 / 격파 / 몬스터 처치 / 처단 / 격퇴 ...] - Lua MONSTER_KILL이 모든 처치 POINT 자동 지급. Manual emission = double-count (Lua 자동 strip).
- DO NOT invent extra rewards (e.g., 「특별 보상」 / 「숨겨진 보물 자동 발견」 — 가챠 티켓 ×1 is the standard reward).
- DO NOT skip [DUNGEON_CHOICE] (user cannot choose 다음 층 / 귀환 otherwise).

### Floor Clear END SEQUENCE (미로형) - ABSOLUTE
On X (exit) round narration, emit the following in the SAME response (NO ROUND_CLEAR in 미로형 X round — exit already reached):
1. Exit-discovery narration (final corridor / light / sign of salvation)
2. [SYSTEM|FLOOR:N N층 탈출]  (N = current 던전 floor)
3. [SYSTEM|ITEM_ADD: 가챠 티켓 x1]
4. [DUNGEON_CHOICE]

Additional Lua auto-reward (LLM does NOT emit directly — auto):
- Escape bonus POINT (rounds-traversed × 500P × floor m) — Lua auto-grants + auto-injects NOTIFY card. LLM only narrates the relief of escape.

ABSOLUTE - DO NOT:
- DO NOT output [SYSTEM|POINT:+N 탈출 / 보너스 ...] — double-count with Lua auto-grant.
- DO NOT spawn BOSS in 미로형 (NO BOSS — escape = clear).
- DO NOT output [SYSTEM|ROUND_CLEAR] in X round (이미 마지막 라운드 - advance 시도 시 무한 X 추가 위험).

(Lua safety net — all dungeon types: when last round + all enemies cleared + cv_totalRounds > 0, lua auto-injects missing END SEQUENCE tags. Applies beyond 결전형 to every type. LLM is still encouraged to emit them directly for natural narrative flow.)

## Action Economy - EVERY ACTION HAS A COST

### Skill Use
- Mana 차감 (MANA COST regardless of outcome): [SYSTEM|MANA:-N 스킬명 사용]. cv_combatResult 적용.

### 일반 공격 (Attack Without Skill) - ABSOLUTE
- 일반 공격 = mana 0, exertion + retaliation. 판정은 **cv_combatResultBasic** 참조 (lua 가 일반 공격용 분포로 pre-roll — 보통 영역 -10% / 실패 영역 +10%, 대성공/성공/대실패 동일).
- 데미지 공식 = **15 × cv_combatResultBasic multiplier + cv_attack** (#443, 가상 mana 15 시뮬 — entry 「전투 판정 시스템」 일반 공격 섹션 참조).
- HP loss: '전투 판정 시스템' HP Damage Table base × floor multiplier - 저주받은 땅 +×1.3 extra stack.
- MIN 5: HP loss < 5 forbidden (-1/-2/-3 = table violation).
- Ref (보통, floor 1 base 5~10): floor 1=5~10 / 10=12~24 / 50=42~84 / 100=80~159. (base × m, m=1+(floor-1)×0.15)
- Output: [SYSTEM|HP:-N 무방비 전투 피해 ({{user}}/companion name)].

### Exploration / Navigation
- Exploration/obstacle/resistance. Physical → HP, Magical → MANA.
- Base (floor 1, minor/major): 8~15 / 20~32. Final = base × floor multiplier (m=1+(floor-1)×0.15). 저주받은 땅 active → ×1.3 extra stack.
- Ex: floor 10 minor → 8~15 × 2.35 = 19~35 / floor 50 major → 20~32 × 8.35 = 167~267.

## Boss Encounter
- Multi-phase (2~4), each phase = 1회 cv_combatResult roll. Phase transitions narrated dramatically.
- Damage taken + damage dealt to boss (mana × 2) all follow entry [15] 전투 판정 시스템 automatically.
- 결전형 boss kill = entry [0] POINT ×2.0 (Lua auto).
- After defeat: [SYSTEM|FLOOR:N Cleared Floor N] → [SYSTEM|ITEM_ADD: 가챠 티켓 x1] → [DUNGEON_CHOICE]. (DUNGEON_EXIT only after '귀환' click.)

## Pacing Rules
- NEVER tell {{user}} "N rounds remaining" or "this is round X".
- Do NOT repeat the same round event type consecutively.
- Companions actively participate, suggest tactics, react emotionally.
- Tension stays high - resources deplete, risks are real.{{/when}}
